      "abyss-3": "I carry a light for nobody, south and a touch west in the Abyss.",
      "abyss-4": "Nothing moves in my water. West, in the Abyss.",
      "abyss-5": "Worth less than a coin and twice as hard to find, far west in the Abyss.",
      "ancient_deep-0": "Before anything, there was me. East, in the Ancient Deep.",
      "ancient_deep-1": "Something grew me and left me, south-east in the Ancient Deep.",
      "ancient_deep-2": "Past me the map gives up. South, in the Ancient Deep.",
